    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65000" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαργαίνω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάργος</span>)
		only in pres., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rage
				furiously</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαργαίνειν ἀνέηκεν ἐπ᾽ ἀθανάτοισι
					θεοῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.882
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύες ἐπὶ φορυτῷ μαργαίνουσιν</span>
			<i>are madly greedy</i> after . . , <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				147
			</span></i>: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαργαίνοντι χαριζόμενος βασιλῆϊ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Coluth.
					198
				</span></i>
			.</div>
